# Differential oracle for water_td_singlet: ORCA 6.1.1 TDA on the same
# relaxed water geometry with B3LYP/G, the VWN3 functional PySCF's b3lypg
# names, no RI, three singlet roots. A band between the two programs is
# measured and recorded, never scored.
! RHF B3LYP/G def2-SVP NoRI TightSCF DefGrid3
%maxcore 1000
%tddft
  nroots 3
  tda true
end
* xyz 0 1
O   0.083323   0.083323  -0.000000
H   1.043716  -0.026894  -0.000000
H  -0.026894   1.043716   0.000000
*
